{"id":"vod_bf_46706","vodId":"46706","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"灼眼的夏娜第一季","name_cn":"灼眼的夏娜第一季","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-47/8c55751ac0e106a1633a0c047c8eb184.jpg"},"summary":"坂井悠二的高中生活刚刚开始，本将一直持续的平凡生活却因为一次偶然而发生了剧变。　　回家途中，商店街的时空突然停止，这封闭空间中所有人的灵魂都被魔物吸去。而手持日本刀与魔物战斗的灼眼红发美少女，告诉了悠二惊人的真相“你已经死了，现在的你只不过是以另一种形态活着。”　　接受了这个事实的悠二决定与这位灼眼红发美少女一起为世界而战，并以少女的武器名来称呼她为“夏娜”。为了世界的未来，夏娜被卷入了一次又一次的战斗之中，二人的羁绊就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:17:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexianadiyiji/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuoyandexia